    "head_branch": "chore/get-godot-script",
    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): fetch the pinned Godot on demand (get_godot.sh)\n\nA cloud session without Godot runs ci/godot/scripts/get_godot.sh when a\nstep first needs tests. It installs CI's GODOT_VERSION into /opt/godot\n(or GODOT_DIR), checks the zip against Godot's published SHA-512 sums,\nimports the project, and prints the GODOT_BIN to export; a second run\nis a no-op. It tries the GitHub release, then downloads.godotengine.org.\nThe run-phase skill and ci/godot/README.md point to it, in place of the\nsetup script the skill assumed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q4r1Pento9bfttpwCkibux",
